#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Duty Board v3.151.0 — POS 7: The Voucher Programme (pass 7 of 8).

Stored value from mint to breakage: the Voucher Console end to end
— sellable vs complimentary and the activation gate, the accounts
setup with the liability-never-revenue rule, design and creation,
printing rules, the counter's sell-and-redeem with the day's till
batch, the register and void discipline, the four-event accounting
spine with deliberate breakage, and the stored-value fraud map at
full depth. Manual depth from birth: 9 chapters, 35-bank.

Deploy: apply -> commit -> then on the server:
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_pos_pro.seed_pos_pro_track

Anchored, idempotent. Requires v3.150.0.
Run from ~/frappe-bench/apps/duty_board.
"""

